        "sid": "NUM 14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "14",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuteghyö nyu pich akïriryö löwïr aghononi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïngwïrngwïronchï pich löwïr Musa nko Aron akïlenchï chane, “Kitö ngwangwa kemeghyechinöcha koro Misri anta surkwen! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ompö ne tökumïtwecha ECHOTYON koronï, lö so tökewonyenöcha ompö chok? Kïnömöy korucha nko monïnge. Möngwangwanye ye kemïlisyö Misri?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay kilenchï kegh, “Kekïla kintöghoghin akemïlisyö Misri.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiwirchï kegh ngwïny Musa nko Aron ompö nyitat ompö tawu pipö Israel löwïr. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïpalpal sïrokökwa Yoswö wero Nun nko Kalep wero Yepune, cho kimi nko pïchay kipa kïghotisyö, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akïlenchï pipö Israel, “Karam nyoman koronini kikïpecha keghot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atochamecha ECHOTYON, kumïtecha akïkonecha koronini yintegho chö nko kumat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.3.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Epr 3:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyo magh nyo gha atagh ECHOTYON amawagh pipö pö koronini, ompöwölo kïrïntocha chane le kwïle. Mi ECHOTYON nko acha melö tökïtïng chane kingörokut, kïlenyona mowöghisyö.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo kïlö pipö Israel, kewirena koghïn pïchï, wölo panini lawel kïsïwa pïchay ororyo ECHOTYON nyo kilïwï ompö paraku Ema kulïwchï pipö Israel löwïr.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kösoghchï Musa pich",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï ECHOTYON Musa, “Sösanïn pïchï nko oyï su? Akïtöghöy kughananïn nko oyï, kïrökegh koporchan chane töngönchintin cho chang? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyonchinan chane sömewut cho ghach achengan mïlatengwa, wölo oghinyi lïkuna papoto punton nyo wow akï awes kïtïl chane.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.32.11+EXO.32.12+EXO.32.13+EXO.32.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wuw 32:11-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo kïlenchï Musa ECHOTYON, “Kimïtunenyi pïchï Misri ompö owesyengu. Nyini kalïm nyu pipö Misri kïgh nyo keghchinyi piköku, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mwochini nyu pïchï möngöy koronï. Kikikïlïm pïchï lö iminyi nko acha akesïwinyi otini keghyongö poltengu parakuncha aintöghoghwechanyi pöghet ompö pchöri polta nko pchöri ma ompö oghö. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ato iparanyi ye pïchï, kïlentöy puntonï cho kikïlïm ororyengu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "keparanyi piköku ompö surkwen ompöwölo melö kemukanyi ntemït chane kwit kor nyo kiyomisyinyi chane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Osoghinyi ye nyu Echotyon lö porwecha owesyengu aigh kïrïp kegh nko kiyomisötengu nyo kimwaghanyi lö, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.20.5+EXO.20.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wuw 20:5-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.34.6+EXO.34.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "34:6-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.5.9+DEU.5.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Krt 5:9-10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.7.9+DEU.7.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "7:9-10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ‘Melö nyölo ECHOTYON lawel, tïng chomnyogh nyo möminye söröm akïlöstoghchini pich ghöyityö nko lelutkökwa. Töko monïng ghöyïntino papotïnekwa pïnta nyo pö sömök nko nyo pö angwan.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Osoghinyi ye ECHOTYON lö mötoghchinö pïchï lelutkökwa, kïrïp kegh nko chomyengu nyo möminye söröm le ato kilöstoghchinyi chane kïngeta kïpkana Misri.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlö nyu ECHOTYON, “Kolöstoghchan chane ompö saghatengu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.3.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Epr 3:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo kïle ato osöpan nko ororyenyan nyo kinyïghï ngwïny, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "möminye chi ompö akong ompö pïchï kikïsïwa ororyenyan nko töngönchintin cho kyaghan ompö Misri nko ompö surkwen, wölo kikïtyamanïn chane kïnyïl taman akïtagh kïterwanïn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Metönye chane kor nyo kyoyomisyan papotïnekwa. Mölïtönye chane cho kisasanïn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.14.9+JOS.14.10+JOS.14.11+JOS.14.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 14:9-12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo ompöwölo kitïng Kalep mïkulögh nyo sis akitas tagh nyinte kïkonyïtanïn, omïtan nyinte ntökwit koronini kiwö kïghot akïmïlöy monechi koronini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Möngöy pipö Amalek nko pipö Kanan mpöghoghöyi. Waghakena ye nyu asïyech aiwö itang surkwen wölnö portoy Nanam nyo Pïrir.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ketö ECHOTYON pich sitöt ompöwölo köngwïrngwïron",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï ECHOTYON Musa nko Aron, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ngwïrngwïronchinanïn mwokïyichï pö pich nko oyï su nya? Kyaghakan ompö ngwïrngwïrönötengwa! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwochinö nyu chane lö, ‘Kïle ato osöpan, oghwokwa kïgh nyo katepakwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.3.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Epr 3:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omeghokwa kïghömï mïntïruchkökwa surkwen akï ompöwölo kongwïrngwïronchanïkwa, möminye ompö akwa chi nyo tïng könyis tömönut odeny kutok nyo itöy koronini, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wölo möminye ye nyu chi ompö akong nyo itöy koronini kyoyomisön lö omöngekwa, kïpoto Kalep wero Yepune nko Yoswö. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo opan monekwa, chï olentekwa lïku naman, ntökwit koronï kataghakwa, akïlïku korengwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo omeghyechinekwa cho le akwa surkwen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lïku monekwa mösöw ompö surkwen könyis tömönut angwan akuwongu ompöwölo kimotïngetekwanye kighanat, ntökïtenö kïma nyo pö söröm ompö akwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onyorukwa nyarïl ompö könyis tömönut angwan akwompö ghöyïnto ngokikwa, lïku asis akong köny akonga kïrïp kegh nko osiswechini le tömönut angwan kyaghotakwa kore, atosöwunökwa lö gha nyoman kelelchï ECHOTYON.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani ECHOTYON nyo kamwagh lö, oghwokwa lenyoni akwa pïchï ghach kotuyekwa aghwanïn ghöyityö, omeghyechinekwa surkwenï lömïs.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kipara ECHOTYON sömew pïchay kiyonta Musa kïpa kïghot koronay, wölo kipu lökoy cho ghach cho kigh pich kïngwïrngwïronchï ECHOTYON. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.36+NUM.14.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.36",
              "NUM.14.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ompö ghotichay le taman nko odeny, Yoswö nko Kalep wero Yepune cho kingötï opïn.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Tyamate nyo tagh kelït koronini",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïmwochï Musa pipö Israel ngalechay kamwa ECHOTYON, kïlokyö chane nyoman. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïngetyö nyini le tökwogha asis nyo kirïptoy akïpusta wölo le kamas akïlö, “Kïpetecha ye nyu kelïtöy koronini kimwa ECHOTYON, ompöwölo kikeghacha ngokï.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo kïlö Musa, “Ompö ne ye nyu tolelchinökwa ECHOTYON? Melö tökumukisyot ngalechoni! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mapa atömowonyö ompö tawu punkökwo ompöwölo möminye ECHOTYON nko akwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi tawunkwa pipö Amalek nko pipö Kanan akïrïntonokwa chane, ompöwölo melö torïpekwa ECHOTYON, nyo makïminye nyinte nko akwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo kïmak chane kïpusta kamas, kïrkegh kitomönye kïweghö Santuku Muma* möngot nko Musa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay nyu kïrokï pipö Amalek nko pipö Kanan cho kimöngöy komos, akiporyeghö chane akiparata ntökwit Orma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kirurut pö amöros",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
